  "local_changes": [
    "Fail if a requested extension cannot be loaded or linked.",
    "Reject unresolved relocation, dyld and chained-fixup imports instead of binding them to a panic trampoline.",
    "Add a Linux host Bazel target.",
    "Apply and validate classic x86_64 KEXT_BUNDLE pointer and PC-relative relocations instead of skipping them.",
    "Preserve the child kernel DATA_CONST extent separately from the collection aggregate, and avoid mutating the input header.",
    "Remove the inactive standalone build script for the former multi-platform loader; Bazel constructs the supported collections.",
    "Remove inactive CMake/Nix recipes; the supported builds use Bazel.",
    "Restrict collection tooling to thin x86_64/ARM64 Mach-O; remove ARM32/Thumb, RISC-V, standalone prelink and classic-output paths. Retain the shared prelink assembly library used internally by MH_FILESET construction."
